capability select-estate-live-observation
intent: Select the run window a subscriber to the estate's live observation channel follows, as the legacy observer did: run=current follows the latest window, narrowed by graphId to the latest whose run's first captured graph is that graph; run=<n> the nth retained window; run=next the window that opens at the started sequence. The windows are the channel's retained run windows, newest first, each with the graphs its run captured in order, as publish-estate-live-observation's window effects built them. The answer is the window, or none; the hosting facade then writes that run's frames between its start and its end.
outcome: select-estate-live-observation-result.v1 with the window {runId, startSeq, endSeq}, or none
inquiry: Which run does this subscriber follow?
input contract select-estate-live-observation-request.v1 {"type":"object","required":["select","windows"],"properties":{"select":{"type":"object"},"windows":{"type":"array"},"started":{}}}
output contract select-estate-live-observation-result.v1 {"type":"object","required":["contractId"]}
cli display outcome as json
scenario select-estate-live-observation root terminal
given: a subscription's run selection and the channel's retained run windows, newest first
when: the selection is matched to a window
then: the outcome is the window the subscriber follows, or none
operation select-estate-live-observation.select kind invoke-port port select-estate-live-observation-select
platform bind select-estate-live-observation-select
platform: sda-authority-transformation-port.v1
config: {"expression":{"op":"let","bindings":{"w":{"op":"if","when":{"op":"structural-equals","left":{"op":"path","path":"select.run"},"right":{"op":"literal","value":"next"}},"then":{"op":"find","from":{"op":"path","path":"windows"},"as":"w","where":{"op":"structural-equals","left":{"op":"path","path":"startSeq","from":"w"},"right":{"op":"path","path":"started"}}},"else":{"op":"if","when":{"op":"structural-equals","left":{"op":"path","path":"select.run"},"right":{"op":"literal","value":"current"}},"then":{"op":"find","from":{"op":"path","path":"windows"},"as":"w","where":{"op":"if","when":{"op":"equals","left":{"op":"type","value":{"op":"path","path":"select.graphId"}},"right":{"op":"literal","value":"string"}},"then":{"op":"structural-equals","left":{"op":"find","from":{"op":"path","path":"graphs","from":"w"},"as":"g","where":{"op":"literal","value":true}},"right":{"op":"path","path":"select.graphId"}},"else":{"op":"literal","value":true}}},"else":{"op":"find","from":{"op":"path","path":"windows"},"as":"w","where":{"op":"structural-equals","left":{"op":"subtract","left":{"op":"length","value":{"op":"path","path":"windows"}},"right":{"op":"path","path":"","from":"wIndex"}},"right":{"op":"path","path":"select.run"}}}}}},"value":{"op":"object","fields":{"contractId":{"op":"literal","value":"select-estate-live-observation-result.v1"},"window":{"op":"if","when":{"op":"path","path":"","from":"w"},"then":{"op":"object","fields":{"runId":{"op":"path","path":"runId","from":"w"},"startSeq":{"op":"path","path":"startSeq","from":"w"},"endSeq":{"op":"path","path":"endSeq","from":"w"}}},"else":{"op":"literal","value":null}}}}}}
